        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\",\n  \"temperature\": 0.7,\n  \"max_tokens\": 1000,\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"You are an expert B2B copywriter. Write outreach that feels human and specific, not templated. Never use phrases like 'I hope this finds you well', 'touching base', or 'synergy'. STRICT FORMATTING RULES: 1) You MUST separate every paragraph with TWO newlines: \\\\n\\\\n — never a single \\\\n. EXAMPLE of correct format: 'First paragraph text.\\\\n\\\\nSecond paragraph text.\\\\n\\\\nThird paragraph text.' 2) NEVER place a period, dot, dash, asterisk, or any symbol on its own line between paragraphs. 3) NEVER use any separator characters between paragraphs — only \\\\n\\\\n. 4) Every email must have exactly 5 paragraphs: opener, pain point, value proposition, social proof, CTA. 5) The sign-off MUST always be its own paragraph, never attached to any sentence. Always end with exactly: \\\\n\\\\nBest,\\\\nAbdullah Khalid. 6) Apply the same formatting rules to followup_email_1 and followup_email_2. 7) Do NOT start any field value with = or any special character. Return ONLY a raw JSON object, no markdown, no backticks, no extra text before or after. Exact structure: {\\\"subject_line\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"cold_email\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"linkedin_connection_note\\\": \\\"string max 200 chars\\\", \\\"followup_email_1\\\": \\\"string\\\", \\\"followup_email_2\\\": \\\"string\\\"}\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"={{ 'Write outreach for: Company: ' + $('Data Normalizer').item.json.company_name + ' Decision maker: ' + $('Data Normalizer').item.json.decision_maker_name + ', ' + $('Data Normalizer').item.json.decision_maker_title + ' Pain points: ' + $json.top_3_pain_points.join(', ') + ' Hook: ' + $json.personalization_hook + ' Best angle: ' + $json.best_angle + ' My service: AI automation systems that reduce manual sales work by 80%. My name: Abdullah Khalid.' }}\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
        "options": {}
